{
  "rationale": "The plant models the robot's motion and perception capabilities, separating motion commands from sensor outcomes. The specification encodes safe, coverage-biased exploration: random_walk dominates in clear, safe states; move_forward is used for short progress; obstacle events trigger conservative, directed recovery turns; full_rotate is reserved for rare, persistent blockage. All transitions are deterministic, and uncontrollables are total in every state.",
  "strategy": [
    "Separate plant automata for motion and perception to reflect open-loop actuation and asynchronous sensing.",
    "Specification automaton encodes safe, coverage-oriented exploration: random_walk in clear, rotate recovery on obstacles, and quick return to exploration after recovery."
  ],
